{"unit_id":"BrianHIO-x__dsh-think-expand#feature-1","repo":"BrianHIO-x/dsh-think-expand","commit":"de9b074e6cc832766e8ad09412d140bb729975c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-expand 的功能「会话 Think 开关」：点击会话标题栏的 Think 按钮，切换该会话全部 Think 行的展开状态。开启时也会打开容纳 Think 的折叠分组和轮次。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:467-518","client.js:547-574","client.js:596-632"]}
