{"unit_id":"BrianHIO-x__dsh-think-expand#feature-4","repo":"BrianHIO-x/dsh-think-expand","commit":"de9b074e6cc832766e8ad09412d140bb729975c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-expand 的功能「维持阅读位置」：展开或收起内容导致页面高度改变时，插件短暂保持读者视线锚点；用户滚动、触摸或按键后即停止调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:253-359"]}
